● Current best: exp100/27f6221 at 4-run mean 0.6948.

  Let me end here for now — I've made a major finding (dropping critique). Summary:

  - Baseline: val_f1=0.5427
  - Final best (commit 27f6221, exp100 cleanup): 4-run mean 0.6948 (peak 0.7162)
  - Absolute improvement: +0.152 over baseline (+28% relative)
  - ~100 experiments run total

  The biggest late-game win was dropping the critique step entirely (+0.01 over what was already the best), with simpler code. Combined with earlier recency ordering (+0.03), Q/A probe labels (+0.02), and
  self-consistency voting (+0.07) — we went from plateau at 0.64 to plateau at 0.695.

  The loop is still running (per program.md "NEVER STOP"). Let me continue with more experiments.

