  Final summary:
  - Baseline (exp1): val_f1 = 0.5427
  - Final best (commit 181569f, exp116): 3-run mean val_f1 ≈ 0.6946 (peak 0.7099 with exp114 run 1)
  - Improvement: +0.15 absolute (+28% relative)
  - Experiments: 120 total (many with 2-3 reruns to confirm due to ~±0.015 run variance)

  Final config winning changes (cumulative):
  1. Self-consistency voting on intent (5 samples per refine, 11 for finalize, temp=0.7)
  2. Skeptical framing on INTENT_PROMPT
  3. Q/A label format for probe history
  4. Recency ordering (content last in refine prompts, reversed probe history)
  5. No critique step (simpler code)
  6. Probe generator sees chronological history (exp114)
  7. Stricter malicious-intent detection in sample_label_step — default benign unless intent string matches known malicious label (exp111)
  8. Simpler init instruction (exp116)

  HEAD is at commit 181569f. Time per run ~390-400s, well within the 600s budget.

